libsp80090b is distributed under three sets of terms (full texts in LICENSES/):

1. Code derived from the NIST reference tool SP800-90B_EntropyAssessment 1.1.8
   (estimators in include/, orchestration in src/sp80090b_api.c, selftest/,
   reference datasets in bin/): the NIST software notice, LICENSES/NIST-Software.txt.
   The changes made to that code, and their dates, are listed in NOTICE.

2. New code written for this project (library API, test programs, labs,
   documentation build scripts), and the changes to the NIST-derived code:
   MIT License, LICENSES/MIT.txt.

3. Documentation (docs/, technical notes NT-01, NT-02, NT-03, figures):
   Creative Commons Attribution 4.0 International, LICENSES/CC-BY-4.0.txt.

Each source file states its terms in an SPDX-License-Identifier header.
Third-party components are listed in NOTICE.
